client/android/.idea/
client/android/captures/
*.keystore
!debug.keystore
# Shared DEBUG signing key, intentionally committed. It is not a secret
# (password is the Android default) but it MUST be identical across CI
# builds — otherwise every APK is signed with a fresh key and Android
# refuses to install the update over the existing app.
!keystore/shared-debug.keystore
